<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Project xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/developer/msbuild/2003">
  <!--
    The RenderWare libraries as build dependencies: a project that imports this builds the libraries
    that are missing or out of date (Lib\Release_x64, Lib\Release) before itself. Up to date ones are skipped.
    Build order only, the importing project still links them through its own AdditionalDependencies.
    They only have a Release configuration, so a Release4Tools project gets them as Release as well.

    Left out:
    - rwcore: it has no sources and builds nothing.
    - rpworld, rpcollis, rptoon: the NTL versions in Lib\Ntl_Plugin_World, Ntl_Plugin_Collis and
      Ntl_Plugin_Toon replace them (same library names). Building the stock ones would put a second
      rpworld.lib / rpcollis.lib / rptoon.lib first on the library path.
  -->
  <ItemGroup>
